{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50236","headline":"无题（伯三一九七） · 卢茂钦","name":"无题（伯三一九七）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"躺游仙院覩灵台，罗绮分明塑匠裁。\n高绾绿鬟{髟/云}（云）髻重，手垂罗袖牡丹开。\n（「手垂」，项目疑当作「平垂」，与「高绾」爲对。\n）容仪一见情难舍，玉貌重看意嬾回。\n若表恳成（诚）心所志，愿将恣貌梦中来。\n（「恣」，蒋、项皆云当作「姿」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢茂钦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}